# STRIDE DFD: patient portal, clinical application, external insurer, and protected health-record stores cross trust boundaries.
threatmodel "Healthcare Records STRIDE"
external Patient: Patient Portal User
external Insurer: Insurance Payer
process Portal: Patient Portal
process EHR: Clinical EHR Service
datastore Records: Protected Health Records
datastore Audit: Access Audit Log
Patient -> Portal : portal request
Portal -> EHR : authenticated request
EHR -> Records : record query
EHR -> Audit : access event
EHR -> Insurer : claim submission
boundary "Public" { Patient, Insurer }
boundary "Hospital DMZ" { Portal }
boundary "Clinical Network" { EHR, Records, Audit }
